 * \section SerialPort_PortInfo Serial port info
 *
 * Getting informations about available serial ports.
 *
 * QSerialPortInfo provides information about existing serial ports.
 *
 * To list the available serial ports, for example in a QComboBox
 * (or maybe in a QTableView),
 * Mdt::SerialPort::PortInfoListTableModel can be used.
 *
 * While QSerialPortInfo can only be constructed for an existing port on the system,
 * we have to be able to test the access model without any port available (f.ex. CI).
 * Because this is the case for other parts (than the table model),
 * Mdt::SerialPort::PortInfo has been introduced.
 *
 * \startuml "Serial port info list table model"
 * !include ClassDiagrams/SerialPortInfoListTableModel.puml
 * \enduml
 *
 * \sa https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qserialportinfo.html
 * \sa Mdt::SerialPort::PortInfo
 * \sa Mdt::SerialPort::PortInfoListTableModel
 *
